# Shell scripts must stay LF — cloud sessions run them on Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Fulcrum 01.11 (25/09/2026): EVERY text file is LF in the working tree too,
# on every OS. The index was already LF; with core.autocrlf=true a Windows
# checkout wrote CRLF to disk (659 files measured), so a tool reading the disk
# saw a different file from CI (Linux). No symptom was measured here — the
# Dart toolchain and every test pass either way — so this is preventive, the
# same defect the Fulcrum repo fixed in card 01.9. Binaries are detected by
# text=auto and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
